WEBVTT

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.940
Listen closely now, Sports Maximum.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.270
Just as land comprises 30% of the planet

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:55.650
and water comprises 70%,

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.200
a certain number of souls
are able to inhabit this planet.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:05.540
The more that humans populate this earth,

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:10.710
proportionately, fewer of
the other organisms can inhabit it.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:15.340
The total number of souls
constantly remains fixed.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:20.260
Now, let's suppose that
there's a way for one human

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:24.640
to possess dozens, no,
hundreds of thousands of souls.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.100
What will this human see?

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:32.690
What does the future hold
for such a human?

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:37.240
I couldn't even begin to guess.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.200
It's an interesting thought, though.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.450
So, what is it that you want me to do?

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.660
Sports Maximum.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.290
I wanted to ask you about this bone.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:55.250
There's something I want you
to try doing to it.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.970
Try to revive this bone.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:02.050
Is that a human bone?

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.090
Whose is it?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.510
That doesn't concern you.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:08.350
Let's just say it belongs to
an old friend of mine.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:13.770
You're telling me to revive it,
but that's just a tiny piece.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.150
Or do you mean to tell me that
the entire skeleton is somewhere else?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.190
Can a single bone even be revived?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.410
Dio…

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.370
This is his last remaining bone.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:29.700
The rest of him is dust.
They no longer exist in this world.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.040
But you must try, Sports Maximum.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:36.250
If you fail, surely you understand

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:39.920
that the ability I bestowed
will no longer be yours.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.180
I get that.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.180
But I already tried.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.770
It's done already.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.440
What's happening?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:01.320
Where is the bone?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.780
Where did it go?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.240
Where is Dio's bone?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.490
What did you do to it?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.540
Where is his bone? Now tell me!

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.040
The hell should I know?

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.540
That's not a normal bone, now, is it?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.760
That bone is beyond my ability's control.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:32.230
The bone is moving around by itself.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.980
But I can sense it.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.980
I sense it moving around close by.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.570
Search for it! Get going, now!

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:47.490
Hold it, Sports Maximum.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.580
This proves his theory.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:57.330
There definitely is a way
to get to heaven.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.670
Do not chase the bone. Leave it be.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:04.880
Let his bone wander about freely.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:08.010
I shall merely observe its movements.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.850
Then, I will combine it
with Jotaro Kujo's memory.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.970
I will learn the truth!

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:18.600
I feel the bone's presence
from the Ultra Security House Unit.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.650
Someone may have picked it up.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.530
That was Sports Maximum's memory
Ermes retrieved by coincidence.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.790
Of course, Jolyne already watched it.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:36.620
Then Jolyne got punished on purpose

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:41.170
so that she gets confined at
the Disciplinary Wing to find the bone!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.590
Yes. But it's too reckless.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.840
Pale Snake must be aware that
we read Sports Maximum's memory.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.720
Now, he will do everything
within his power

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.140
to eliminate Jolyne.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.640
Jolyne will not last in that wing
by herself.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.650
I am able to exist like this
thanks to Jolyne.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.610
But I don't know what I can do.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.900
I want your help.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:09.660
I can't. Even Weather Forecast,
who is recuperating in the infirmary,

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.740
cannot reach that part of the facility.

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:15.540
I wish I could help, but…

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.750
The Maximum Security Disciplinary Wing,

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:23.090
or Ultra Security House Unit,
is southeast of the male wing.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:26.920
To reach it, you must first leave
the premises on a transport car.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.090
There are no secret passages there either.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.640
I've never even been there.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:37.350
So I don't know how
I can keep Jolyne safe.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.600
I'm not asking you to keep her safe.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:44.360
I only want you to sneak me
inside the Ultra Security House Unit.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:51.570
Hey, is there anything you can do for us?

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.530
You can't expect him to help.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.240
Anastasia wouldn't cooperate.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:59.330
But isn't he a Stand User?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.960
Were you born with your ability?

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.300
Like I said, don't count on Anastasia.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:13.590
He will not cooperate with anyone,
no matter the reason.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.930
Why is that?

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:16.680
It's because…

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:19.390
I'm willing to do anything.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:23.150
If you take me to
the Ultra Security House Unit,

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:26.190
-I'll do anything to repay you--
-Stop, F.F.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:30.150
He just isn't the type of person
who helps others out.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.660
What I'm trying to say is, well…

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:37.290
Have you heard of Anastasia, his name?

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.040
He's a murderer.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:45.500
Anastasia's full name
is Narciso Anastasia.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.420
Ever since he was a child,
for some inexplicable reason,

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.170
he's had a peculiar habit.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.760
No, not really a habit,
but rather, a syndrome.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.810
A syndrome where he has the urge
to disassemble everything.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.730
He just must disassemble what he sees.

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:06.440
When he was ten, he disassembled
his neighbor's Porsche

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.440
and was institutionalized for six months.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.320
One time, he disassembled
a high-voltage telephone pole.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.200
And when he was 21,

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.370
he went over to
his then girlfriend's apartment.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.960
She was in bed with another man.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:32.510
Anastasia disassembled
their bodies on the spot

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.340
so they can never be together again.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.560
The psychiatric analysis conducted
after his arrest

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.020
surprisingly came back normal.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:44.850
That's how he ended up in the Aquarium.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.110
Without Weather Forecast
keeping him under control,

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.730
who knows what he's capable of?

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.780
That's Anastasia.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.440
So please, give up on him.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:58.780
But I can't reach Jolyne by myself.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:00.280
I need backup.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.870
At the least,
I can't do it without his help.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.620
But how strange.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.170
This feeling…

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.420
If he refuses,

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.550
I'll try to coerce him into it
with my ability.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.470
But…

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:19.390
I can't visualize my first shot
successfully hitting him.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:22.100
I don't even know where to aim for.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:27.600
If I'm not willing to kill him,
he won't listen to me.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.900
That's the feeling I get from him,
but still, I must try.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.780
That's the reason why I came.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.610
All right. Okay.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.870
I can go defend her.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.580
Jolyne Cujoh, that is.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.580
-What?
-I will cooperate.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:51.420
And if she wants to find
that bone or something,

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.380
I will help with that too.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.340
Now, let's hurry.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.680
She may be under attack as we speak.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.810
Hold on, Anastasia!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.890
What are you plotting?

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.690
Plotting?

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.270
I just told you.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.070
I will protect her with all my might.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.610
But…

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:19.990
I've taken a liking to her,

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:23.410
and everything about her
the moment I laid my eyes on her.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:28.040
She willingly went to the Disciplinary
Wing to save her father.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.250
Her conviction charms me even more.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:37.090
If I successfully protect her to the end,
then I will marry her.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:38.510
This is my condition.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:39.970
Got that?

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:41.760
F.F., was it?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.640
You said you are willing to do anything.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.680
Then, give us your blessing.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.310
That's what a wedding needs.

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:54.150
What the…

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.610
Do what now?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.320
He said he'll do what
with Jolyne just now?

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.040
Diver Drive!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.760
The hell's going on?

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.300
What was that crash?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:37.480
The attack was delayed,
and it came out of the wall.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:42.910
That's Anastasia's Stand,
Diver Drive's ability.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.160
Give us your blessing.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.920
STAND NAME: SURVIVOR
STAND MASTER: GUCCIO

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.380
Hey, out of curiosity, Dio.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.470
Out of all the Stands you've seen,

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:06.640
which one was the weakest?

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.890
It can be one you encountered
while traveling around the world,

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.100
or one that was created.

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.820
Which one, I wonder.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:21.570
What is considered suitable
is different from person to person.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.570
A king has his strengths…

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.200
and a cook has his own too.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.080
That's what it means to live.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.370
The same goes for Stands.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:34.000
The concept of being strong or weak
does not apply.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.580
I phrased it badly.

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.540
Children argue for fun about things like

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.170
"Which one is stronger,
Stallone and Van Damme?"

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.760
Let's talk on that level.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.850
A Stand I named Survivor is the weakest.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.810
However, Survivor is a handful.

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:54.060
Survivor? Sounds powerful.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.020
It was 1982.

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:02.030
In France's Lorraine region,
a group of six went hiking,

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:05.070
went missing, and then were found dead.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.160
The investigation team stated that

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:11.490
the six broke out into a fight
in the mountains.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.120
They fought each other to death.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.590
Men and women alike applied
such intense force to their muscles

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.760
that their own bones broke.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.970
A tooth that broke
and flew off after a punch

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:27.680
had split a rock and wedged itself there.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.720
That's how brutal the struggle was.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:35.520
Even the victor was unable to descend
the mountain due to his injuries.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:39.440
Here is what I learned later.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.900
The six had stayed in a lodge
the night before they died.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.690
They had quarreled with the lodge owner.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.320
One of the women

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:51.410
ridiculed the lodge owner's body odor,
saying he stunk.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.750
And this lodge owner was a Stand User.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.000
Precisely.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:58.460
But what did this lodge owner do to them?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.130
And why did the six fight to their deaths?

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:04.960
The answer is that he did nothing.

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:08.970
He did nothing to them,
but there was a slight anger

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.930
that surged in his mind.

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:13.560
And that slight anger

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:16.850
converted into a small
electric potential in his brain,

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:22.110
traveled down his nervous system,
and flowed out into the ground.

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:25.400
That's the Stand, Survivor.

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:28.740
The electric current followed
the ground's surface

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.910
all the way to the six hikers.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.030
The ground and the hikers' shoes
had to be wet

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.200
to let the electricity travel easily.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:41.000
The electric potential sending
signals to the nervous system

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.290
is very small, at 70mV.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.920
This Stand dwells in
that slight pulse of energy.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:51.550
Survivor's attack is mostly unnoticed,
and it doesn't cause any harm.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:56.060
It does not injure humans,
nor can it manipulate them.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:59.140
It cannot inflict pain
or put someone to sleep.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.690
The Stand does none of these things.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.900
It simply awakens its victim's anger.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.990
It stimulates the limbic system
of the human brain ever so slightly,

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:13.120
awakening its fighting spirit.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:17.540
Just because one woman
ridiculed the lodge owner's body odor,

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:20.160
all six were made
to fight to their deaths.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:27.460
Earlier, you said it's a handful.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.260
A useless Stand is what it is.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:32.760
It can't tell a friend from foe.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:35.720
If subordinates
started fighting each other,

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.390
their organization would collapse.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:42.060
Could you give me that ability?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.650
If you don't plan on using it,
I'll take just the Stand.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:50.490
Extract the ability only
and store it in a disc, you say?

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.450
That may be a good idea.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.280
To each their own.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:58.200
It may prove useful one of these days.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:07.090
I guess these mushrooms are edible.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:10.090
They're pretty good.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.760
It's shower time.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.560
Get up, FE40536!

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.230
It's bright!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:27.270
Hell yeah! I got her!

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:28.820
She hid!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:31.280
She hid like a dirty cockroach!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.280
I win this cell.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.700
The total sum is 20 dollars for my wins!

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:37.280
Sorry!

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:41.370
Damn. But all I got on me is 15 dollars.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.250
Come on, let's shake on it.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.330
If that's all you got, I guess.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.250
In any case,

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:54.930
what I must do here
is to use this thread to find the bone.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.640
What is that bone doing here?

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:00.470
I don't know the answer yet,

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:05.350
but for some reason, it's somewhere
inside this Disciplinary Wing.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.060
Could it be in someone's possession?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:14.030
If I can obtain the bone first,
Pale Snake will come after me.

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.200
And with him,

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:20.280
my father's stolen memory disc
in his hand!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.790
Hey dumbass!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.500
Who told you to stand?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.880
By the way,

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:34.010
how do you think
the Marlins will play tonight?

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:35.630
Their chances of winning are slim.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:39.090
The pitcher broke up
with that reporter girl.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.850
He won't throw any strikes.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.640
You want to bet those 15 dollars on it?

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.850
I'm in.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:48.270
Aren't you short on money, though?

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:50.480
I'm telling you, his throws will be bad.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.610
No, that pitcher is good.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.740
You're such easy prey.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.410
Can't wait for tonight's game.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.460
Oh, sorry.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.250
This valve doesn't close very easily.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.000
Be more careful.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:15.340
I have to go back to the main prison
to change.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.260
Hey, why did you hit me?

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.970
I said I'm sorry.

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:27.390
It's not like I got you wet on purpose.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:30.810
Oh, did I hit you just now?

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.490
The hell is wrong with you?

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.860
I didn't smack you that hard.

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:41.120
You want some?

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:45.200
You didn't need to punch me hard, bastard.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.710
-You jerk!
-Asshole!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:52.670
Why you little…

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.800
All right, that's enough.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.210
I said enough.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.510
I said stop.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.760
I'll apologize. I'm sorry.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.550
I'll lend you my uniform
if you don't have a spare.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:06.010
That settles it, right? Let's be done.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:09.890
What got into you? Calm down.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.980
Are you in a bad mood today?

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:18.610
We're friends… right?

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:21.780
That hurts!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:27.790
You swing hard, fucker!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.290
I'll take you on!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:31.790
What has gotten into them?

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.130
It can't be…

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:36.880
I'm getting excited.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.460
His physique…

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.720
I can see where his body's strengths are!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.430
His superbly developed muscles!

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.470
Beautiful…

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:51.980
I can sense
his strongest muscle structures!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:55.150
How wonderful it is to fight!

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.020
What the…

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.980
What's happening to their bodies?

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.610
What are those things that seem to shine?

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:07.950
Here I come.
I'll show you who is stronger!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.550
I am the strongest!

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:32.520
Is this an enemy's attack?

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.810
Is that guard my foe?

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.270
No, the enemy hasn't shown up yet.

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:41.240
But this is a Stand ability!

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:44.150
This freakish feel…
It must be a Stand attack!

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:47.700
"Do not cast what is holy to the dogs;

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.290
lest they trample them under their feet,

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:54.410
and turn and tear you in pieces."

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:57.750
Matthew 7:6.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.880
Sports Maximum has gone missing.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:03.840
I can't fathom how they learned of it,

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:09.050
but I must conclude that
they read his memory.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:13.180
The number of Stand Users
I sent to the Disciplinary Wing…

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:14.770
Four!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.320
If Jolyne Cujoh entered
the Disciplinary Wing

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:23.240
in search of Dio's bone…

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:30.910
I cannot let her live a moment longer.

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:33.330
I will use all my strength
to eliminate her!

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.870
It doesn't really matter what happens
inside the Disciplinary Wing.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.210
Those four will undoubtedly fight on

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:44.720
until Jotaro's daughter is eliminated!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.470
He sent everything he's got.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:57.310
I can see where your strengths are!

00:21:57.890 --> 00:21:59.600
Bastards!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:03.280
I can see

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:08.160
the strongest parts
of each fighter's body from here!

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:10.870
It's Fight Club time!

00:22:10.950 --> 00:22:13.620
Let's brawl!

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:46.290
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
